<div class="card auth" style="max-width:640px">
  <h2>收银台</h2>
  <div class="sim mb">⚠️ 这是模拟支付页面,不会产生真实扣款,也未接入任何真实支付渠道。点击「确认支付」即视为支付成功。</div>
  <div class="flex between mb"><span>订单号:<%= o.order_no %></span><span>应付金额 <span class="price"><big><%= o.pay_amount.toFixed(2) %></big></span></span></div>
  <p class="muted">请在 <b><%= shop.unpaid_cancel_minutes %></b> 分钟内完成支付(创建于 <%= o.created_at %>)</p>
  <form method="post" action="/order/<%= o.id %>/pay">
    <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>">
    <div class="paymethod" style="flex-direction:column">
      <label class="pm on"><input type="radio" name="method" value="wechat" checked><span class="ic" style="background:#07c160">微</span>微信支付(模拟)</label>
      <label class="pm"><input type="radio" name="method" value="alipay"><span class="ic" style="background:#1677ff">支</span>支付宝(模拟)</label>
      <label class="pm"><input type="radio" name="method" value="balance"><span class="ic" style="background:var(--gold-d)">¥</span>账户余额(当前 ¥<%= user.balance.toFixed(2) %>)</label>
    </div>
    <button class="btn primary lg block mt">确认支付 ¥<%= o.pay_amount.toFixed(2) %></button>
  </form>
  <div class="flex between mt"><a href="/order/<%= o.id %>">稍后支付</a>
  <form method="post" action="/order/<%= o.id %>/cancel" data-confirm="确定取消该订单?"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><button class="btn sm danger">取消订单</button></form></div>
</div>
